    "description": [
      "Located near the beach, this vacation home is in Rosemary Beach, a neighborhood in Panama City Beach. Shoppers can check out Pier Park, while everyone can enjoy the natural beauty of Alys Beach and Rosemary Beach. Frank Brown Park and Sundog Books are also worth visiting. Looking to get your feet wet? Jet skiing, scuba diving and windsurfing adventures can be found near the property."
